status GREEN -- control_leg_heard GREEN on metal with 53 control legs and 0 failing; generated_page_freshness GREEN after the rename; exec_bit, ascii_document, spoken_ascii, unshared_citation, shared_pen, tracked_link, link_text_promise, prose_register each GREEN. The whole-roster cold run is named rather than claimed: a stale pass from my elder lap held this tree's lock at a HEAD that had moved, so its verdict was already fixed at tree_moved; it was stopped through the lock's own pid and the lock releases when its guard in flight returns.
